# What the build writes. Only the two halves of the source are committed: the generated tree, which
# travels as source because the artefact is published without the OpenAPI snapshot beside it, and
# everything hand-written next to it.
target/

# Where the pipeline keeps what it resolved, so a run that changed nothing reaches the network for
# nothing. Never committed: it is a cache of what the build file already pins.
.m2/
